n>About the Principal</span></a></li><li><a class="text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 flex items-center gap-2 group" href="/online-payment" data-discover="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right opacity-0 -translate-x-2 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:translate-x-0 transition-all duration-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg><span>Online Payment</span></a></li><li><a class="text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 flex items-center gap-2 group" href="/contact" data-discover="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right opacity-0 -translate-x-2 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:translate-x-0 transition-all duration-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg><span>Contact Us</span></a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-6 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-8 h-0.5 bg-[#C5A03A]"></span>Our Services</h4><ul class="space-y-3"><li><a class="text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 flex items-center gap-2 group" href="/mediation-services" data-discover="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right opacity-0 -translate-x-2 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:translate-x-0 transition-all duration-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg><span>Mediation Services</span></a></li><li><a class="text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 flex items-center gap-2 group" href="/practice-areas" data-discover="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right opacity-0 -translate-x-2 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:translate-x-0 transition-all duration-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg><span>Practice Areas &amp; Case Highlights</span></a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-6 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-8 h-0.5 bg-[#C5A03A]"></span><span>Contact Us</span></h4><div class="space-y-5"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="w-10 h-10 bg-white/10 border border-white/15 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-phone text-white/80" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384"></path></svg></div><div class="flex-1 min-w-0"><p class="text-white/50 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Phone</p><a href="tel:+12025482999" class="text-white/90 hover:text-white transition-colors font-medium">(202) 548-2999</a></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="w-10 h-10 bg-white/10 border border-white/15 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-phone text-white/80