in"/></div><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] mb-4">Education</h3><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed"><span class="mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#1E3A5F] flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Juris Doctorate Degree, Howard University School of Law</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed"><span class="mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#1E3A5F] flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Bachelor of Science Degree, Major Sociology, Minor Business</span></li></ul></article><article class="bg-white rounded-[2rem] p-8 shadow-lg border border-slate-100"><div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#5B2C6F] to-[#3E1A4D] text-white shadow-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl mb-6"><img src="/src/assets/fleur-de-lis.png" alt="Fleur-de-lis" class="w-8 h-8 object-contain"/></div><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] mb-4">Featured in</h3><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed"><span class="mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#1E3A5F] flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Ebony Magazine</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed"><span class="mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#1E3A5F] flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Jet Magazine</span></li></ul></article><article class="bg-white rounded-[2rem] p-8 shadow-lg border border-slate-100"><div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#5B2C6F] to-[#3E1A4D] text-white shadow-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl mb-6"><img src="/src/assets/fleur-de-lis.png" alt="Fleur-de-lis" class="w-8 h-8 object-contain"/></div><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] mb-4">Article Contributor</h3><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed"><span class="mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#1E3A5F] flex-shrink-0"></span><span>The National Bar Association Magazine</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed"><span class="mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#1E3A5F] flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Washington Living Magazine</span></li></ul></article></div></div></section><section class="page-section page-section--white"><div class="section-shell"><div class="portrait-panel" style="grid-template-columns:1fr;text-align:center"><div class="body-copy"><p class="section-script" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:0.6rem">Media Appearances</p><p>Attorney Phyllis J. Outlaw has appeared as a guest on national and local television as well as radio broadcasts</p></div></div><div class="media-marquee" style="margin-top:1.5rem"><div class="media-marquee__track"><img src="/src/assets/media-logos-strip.png" alt="Media appearances including CNN, C-SPAN, FOX News, WUSA 9, WYCB Podcast, WPFW, WHUT, JET, Ebony, Essence, and Bottomline"/><img src="/src/assets/media-logos-strip.png" alt="Media appearances including CNN, C-SPAN, FOX News, WUSA 9, WYCB Podcast, WPFW, WHUT, JET, Ebony, Essence, and Bottomline"/></div></div></div></section></div>"`;

exports[`public site renders unchanged > page /contact 1`] = `"<link rel="preload" as="image" href="/src/assets/Contact%20Us.png"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="https://media.istockphoto.com/photos/aerial-view-of-washington-dc-xxxl-picture-id183367435?k=20&amp;m=183367435&amp;s=612x612&amp;w=0&amp;h=1poAuHDFu4WELeMGIwBHYbAMg294fNdQLsV3HKPbLdI="/><div class="overflow-hidden bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="w-full"><img src="/src/assets/Contact%20Us.png" alt="Contact Us" class="w-full h-auto block"/></div><section class="py-24 relative overflow-hidden" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #1E3A5F 0%, #C5A03A 50%, #5B2C6F 100%)"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url(&#x27;https://grainy-gradients.vercel.app/noise.svg&#x27;)] opacity-10 pointer-events-none"></div><div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-white/5 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-80 h-80 bg-white/5 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10"><div class="grid gap-16"><div class="space-y-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto w-full"><div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md rounded-[2.5rem] p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl border border-white/20 relative overflow-hidden text-center"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] mb-8 relative z-10">Contact Our Office.</h2><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-left relative z-10"><div class="flex items-center gap-6 p-6 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl border border-white/15 group"><div class="w-14 h-14 bg-white/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock text-white/80 group-hover:text-white transition-colors" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle></svg></div><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-bold text-white/60 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Office Hours</p><p class="text-sm sm:text-base lg:text-lg font-bold text-white tracking-tight"><span class="block">Monday to Friday</span><span class="block">9:00 AM to 5:00 PM EST</span></p></div></div><a href="tel:+12025482999" class="flex items-center gap-6 p-6 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl border border-white/15 hover:bg-white/20 transition-all group"><div class="w-14 h-14 bg-white/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-phone text-white/80 group-hover:text-white transition-colors" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384"></path></svg></div><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-bold text-white/60 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Phone</p><p class="text-[0.9rem] sm:text-lg md:text-sm lg:text-base xl:text-xl font-bold text-white truncate">(202) 548-2999</p></div></a><a href="tel:+12025488114" class="flex items-center gap-6 p-6 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl border border-white/15 hover:bg-white/20 transition-all group"><div class="w-14 h-14 bg-white/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-phone text-white/80 group-hover:text-white transition-colors" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384"></path></svg></div><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-bold text-white/60 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Fax</p><p class="text-[0.9rem] sm:text-lg md:text-sm lg:text-base xl:text-xl font-bold text-white truncate">(202) 548-8114</p></div></a><a href="mailto:lawfirm@pjoutlawlegal.com" class="flex items-center gap-6 p-6 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl border border-white/15 hover:bg-white/20 transition-all group"><div class="w-14 h-14 bg-white/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-mail text-white/80 group-hover:text-white transition-colors" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7"></path><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"></rect></svg></div><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-bold text-white/60 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Email</p><p class="text-[0.9rem] sm:text-lg md:text-sm lg:text-base xl:text-xl font-bold text-white truncate">lawfirm@pjoutlawlegal.com</p></div></a></div><div class="mt-10 relative z-10"><a href="tel:+12025482999" class="btn-premium inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-white text-[#1E3A5F] rounded-full font-bold text-lg shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-phone" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384"></path></svg><span>Call Our Office</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 md:py-20 bg-white relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-[#1E3A5F]/5 rounded-full blur-3xl -translate-y-1/2 translate-x-1/2"></div><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center"><div class="space-y-6"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] leading-tight">Serving Maryland &amp;<br/><span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[#1E3A5F] to-[#5B2C6F]">Washington, DC</span></h2><p class="text-base md:text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Phyllis J. Outlaw &amp; Associates have provided legal services to residents and local businesses in Maryland and Washington, DC. Our offices are located in the commercial district which is known for it resurgence and emerging small businesses. Our offices are convenient to the financial and business districts of the city, public transportation, as well as to the federal and local courts located in the District of Columbia and Maryland. Our office is located at:</p><div class="mt-2"><p class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;]">412 H Street, NE</p><p class="text-lg font-medium text-slate-700">Washington, DC 20002</p></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="framed-photo-container h-[260px] md:h-[340px]"><img src="https://media.istockphoto.com/photos/aerial-view-of-washington-dc-xxxl-picture-id183367435?k=20&amp;m=183367435&amp;s=612x612&amp;w=0&amp;h=1poAuHDFu4WELeMGIwBHYbAMg294fNdQLsV3HKPbLdI=" alt="Aerial view of Washington DC skyline"/></div></div></div></div></section></div>"`;

exports[`public site renders unchanged > page /mediation-services 1`] = `"<link rel="preload" as="image" href="/src/assets/Mediation%20page.png"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/src/assets/fleur-de-lis.png"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/src/assets/court%20ordered%20mediation.jpg"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/src/assets/divorce-gender-equality.png"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/src/assets/child%20mediation.png"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/src/assets/business%20mediation.jpg"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/src/assets/office-shoot-264.jpg"/><div class="overflow-hidden bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="w-full"><img src="/src/assets/Mediation%20page.png" alt="Mediation Services" class="w-full h-auto block"/></div><section class="bg-white py-16 md:py-20"><div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><h1 class="font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-slate-900 md:text-5xl">Mediation Services Designed to Deliver Meaningful Results</h1></div></section><section class="py-24"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="space-y-32"><div id="court" class="flex flex-col gap-12 items-center lg:flex-row"><div class="flex-1 space-y-8 animate-enter" style="animation-delay:200ms"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2 bg-blue-50/50 rounded-full border border-slate-100"><img src="/src/assets/fleur-de-lis.png" alt="Fleur-de-lis" class="w-5 h-5 object-contain "/><span class="font-semibold text-slate-700 text-sm tracking-wide uppercase">Complies with Court Standards</span></div><h3 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;]">Court-Ordered Mediation</h3><p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">As a court-appointed Mediator, Phyllis J. Outlaw has successfully mediated numerous Maryland Circuit Court cases, ensuring compliance with Maryland law. The Settlement Agreements that result from mediation are legally enforceable and consistent with court standards.</p></div><div class="flex-1 w-full"><figure class="relative group"><div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-gradient-to-br from--[#2A4F7A] to--[#1E3A5F] opacity-30 rounded-[2.5rem] blur-2xl group-hover:opacity-50 transition-opacity duration-500"></div><div class="relative rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-slate-100 h-[400px]"><img src="/src/assets/court%20ordered%20mediation.jpg" alt="Court-Ordered Mediation" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center"/></div></figure></div></div><div id="family" class="flex flex-col gap-12 items-center lg:flex-row-reverse"><div class="flex-1 space-y-8 animate-enter" style="animation-delay:200ms"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2 bg-[#e8f4f4]/50 rounded-full border border-slate-100"><img src="/src/assets/fleur-de-lis.png" alt="Fleur-de-lis" class="w-5 h-5 object-contain "/><span class="font-semibold text-slate-700 text-sm tracking-wide uppercase">Cooperation for long-term stability</span></div><h3 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;]">Divorce and Family Mediation</h3><p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Helps spouses and families navigate separation, divorce, and post-divorce matters through a cooperative process focused on long-term stability, especially when children are involved. Divorce settlement agreements can address:</p><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check-big text-[#1E3A5F] flex-shrink-0 mt-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335"></path><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"></path></svg><span class="text-slate-600 font-medium">Spousal Alimony Support</span></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check-big text-[#1E3A5F] flex-shrink-0 mt-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335"></path><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"></path></svg><span class="text-slate-600 font-medium">Property and asset division/distribution</span></div></div><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[#5B2C6F] font-bold hover:gap-4 transition-all duration-300 group" href="/contact" data-discover="true"><span>Schedule Your Consultation Today</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div><div class="flex-1 w-full"><figure class="relative group"><div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-gradient-to-br from--[#1E3A5F] to--[#5B2C6F] opacity-30 rounded-[2.5rem] blur-2xl group-hover:opacity-50 transition-opacity duration-500"></div><div class="relative rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-slate-100 h-[400px]"><img src="/src/assets/divorce-gender-equality.png" alt="Divorce and Family Mediation" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center"/></div></figure></div></div><div id="custody" class="flex flex-col gap-12 items-center lg:flex-row"><div class="flex-1 space-y-8 animate-enter" style="animation-delay:200ms"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2 bg-[#e8f4f4]/50 rounded-full border border-slate-100"><img src="/src/assets/fleur-de-lis.png" alt="Fleur-de-lis" class="w-5 h-5 object-contain "/><span class="font-semibold text-slate-700 text-sm tracking-wide uppercase">Balanced agreements for families</span></div><h3 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;]">Child Custody and Visitation Mediation</h3><p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Assists parents in creating balanced, practical parenting agreements that prioritize their children’s best interests while respecting each parent’s rights and responsibilities.</p><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check-big text-[#1E3A5F] flex-shrink-0 mt-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335"></path><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"></path></svg><span class="text-slate-600 font-medium">Child Custody and Parenting Plans</span></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check-big text-[#1E3A5F] flex-shrink-0 mt-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335"></path><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"></path></svg><span class="text-slate-600 font-medium">Child Support agreements</span></div></div><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[#5B2C6F] font-bold hover:gap-4 transition-all duration-300 group" href="/contact" data-discover="true"><span>Schedule Your Consultation Today</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div><div class="flex-1 w-full"><figure class="relative group"><div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-gradient-to-br from--[#2A4F7A] to--[#1E3A5F] opacity-30 rounded-[2.5rem] blur-2xl group-hover:opacity-50 transition-opacity duration-500"></div><div class="relative rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-slate-100 h-[400px]"><img src="/src/assets/child%20mediation.png" alt="Child Custody and Visitation Mediation" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center"/></div></figure></div></div><div id="business" class="flex flex-col gap-12 items-center lg:flex-row-reverse"><div class="flex-1 space-y-8 animate-enter" style="animation-delay:200ms"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2 bg-[#fdf2f4]/50 rounded-full border border-slate-100"><img src="/src/assets/fleur-de-lis.png" alt="Fleur-de-lis" class="w-5 h-5 object-contain "/><span class="font-semibold text-slate-700 text-sm tracking-wide uppercase">Practical resolution for organizations</span></div><h3 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;]">Business Dispute Mediation</h3><p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Disputes involving business partners, employers, employees, vendors, or clients can disrupt operations and strain relationships. Mediation offers a practical way to resolve conflicts while helping companies avoid significant legal costs.</p><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check-big text-[#1E3A5F] flex-shrink-0 mt-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335"></path><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"></path></svg><span class="text-slate-600 font-medium">Partnership Disputes</span></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check-big text-[#1E3A5F] flex-shrink-0 mt-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335"></path><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"></path></svg><span class="text-slate-600 font-medium">Contract Disputes</span></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check-big text-[#1E3A5F] flex-shrink-0 mt-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335"></path><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"></path></svg><span class="text-slate-600 font-medium">Workplace conflicts</span></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check-big text-[#1E3A5F] flex-shrink-0 mt-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335"></path><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"></path></svg><span class="text-slate-600 font-medium">Employer–Employee Disputes</span></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check-big text-[#1E3A5F] flex-shrink-0 mt-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335"></path><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"></path></svg><span class="text-slate-600 font-medium">Vendor Service Disputes</span></div></div><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[#5B2C6F] font-bold hover:gap-4 transition-all duration-300 group" href="/contact" data-discover="true"><span>Schedule Your Consultation Today</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div><div class="flex-1 w-full"><figure class="relative group"><div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-gradient-to-br from--[#5B2C6F] to--[#5B2C6F] opacity-30 rounded-[2.5rem] blur-2xl group-hover:opacity-50 transition-opacity duration-500"></div><div class="relative rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-slate-100 h-[400px]"><img src="/src/assets/business%20mediation.jpg" alt="Business Dispute Mediation" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center"/></div><figcaption class="relative mt-6 text-center"><p class="font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Business Dispute Mediation</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[#5B2C6F]">Available Now</p></figcaption></figure></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-slate-50 relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-30 pointer-events-none"><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#1E3A5F]/50 to-transparent"></div><div class="blob blob-gold w-[800px] h-[800px] top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-10"></div></div><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10"><div class="text-center mb-20"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-[#1E3A5F]/10 rounded-full mb-6 border border-[#1E3A5F]/30"><span class="text-[#5B2C6F] font-bold text-sm tracking-wide uppercase">How Mediation Works</span></div><h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] mb-6">A Seven-Step Path to <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[#1E3A5F] to-[#5B2C6F]">Resolution</span></h2><p class="text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Our structured process offers clear guidance and keeps you informed at every stage.</p></div><div class="relative"><div class="hidden lg:block absolute left-1/2 top-0 bottom-0 w-0.5 bg-slate-200 -translate-x-1/2"></div><div class="space-y-12 relative"><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-8 lg:flex-row"><div class="flex-1 hidden lg:block"></div><div class="relative z-10 flex-shrink-0"><div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-white border-4 border-[#1E3A5F]/20 shadow-xl flex items-center justify-center relative group"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1E3A5F] to-[#5B2C6F] rounded-full opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"></div><span class="text-2xl font-bold font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] text-[#1E3A5F] relative z-10 group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300">1</span></div></div><div class="flex-1 w-full lg:w-auto"><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 relative group overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-2 h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#1E3A5F] to-[#5B2C6F]"></div><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;]">Initial Consultation</h3><p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Discuss your concerns with the mediator to determine whether mediation is the right option and to clarify your goals.</p></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-8 lg:flex-row-reverse"><div class="flex-1 hidden lg:block"></div><div class="relative z-10 flex-shrink-0"><div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-white border-4 border-[#1E3A5F]/20 shadow-xl flex items-center justify-center relative group"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1E3A5F] to-[#5B2C6F] rounded-full opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"></div><span class="text-2xl font-bold font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] text-[#1E3A5F] relative z-10 group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300">2</span></div></div><div class="flex-1 w-full lg:w-auto"><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 relative group overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-2 h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#1E3A5F] to-[#5B2C6F]"></div><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;]">Agreement and Documentation</h3><p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">After signing a mediation agreement with our firm and paying the mediation fee, you will submit the necessary documents and information for the mediator’s review.</p></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-8 lg:flex-row"><div class="flex-1 hidden lg:block"></div><div class="relative z-10 flex-shrink-0"><div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-white border-4 border-[#1E3A5F]/20 shadow-xl flex items-center justify-center relative group"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1E3A5F] to-[#5B2C6F] rounded-full opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"></div><span class="text-2xl font-bold font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] text-[#1E3A5F] relative z-10 group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300">3</span></div></div><div class="flex-1 w-full lg:w-auto"><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 relative group overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-2 h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#1E3A5F] to-[#5B2C6F]"></div><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;]">Contact Parties</h3><p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">All parties are contacted to confirm their willingness to mediate the issues that need resolution.</p></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-8 lg:flex-row-reverse"><div class="flex-1 hidden lg:block"></div><div class="relative z-10 flex-shrink-0"><div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-white border-4 border-[#1E3A5F]/20 shadow-xl flex items-center justify-center relative group"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1E3A5F] to-[#5B2C6F] rounded-full opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"></div><span class="text-2xl font-bold font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] text-[#1E3A5F] relative z-10 group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300">4</span></div></div><div class="flex-1 w-full lg:w-auto"><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 relative group overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-2 h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#1E3A5F] to-[#5B2C6F]"></div><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;]">Mediation Scheduling</h3><p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Once all affected parties agree to proceed, virtual mediation sessions are scheduled at times convenient for everyone.</p></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-8 lg:flex-row"><div class="flex-1 hidden lg:block"></div><div class="relative z-10 flex-shrink-0"><div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-white border-4 border-[#1E3A5F]/20 shadow-xl flex items-center justify-center relative group"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1E3A5F] to-[#5B2C6F] rounded-full opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"></div><span class="text-2xl font-bold font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] text-[#1E3A5F] relative z-10 group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300">5</span></div></div><div class="flex-1 w-full lg:w-auto"><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 relative group overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-2 h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#1E3A5F] to-[#5B2C6F]"></div><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;]">Virtual Conference</h3><p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">A confidential video conference is held to help the parties work toward resolving their issues.</p></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-8 lg:flex-row-reverse"><div class="flex-1 hidden lg:block"></div><div class="relative z-10 flex-shrink-0"><div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-white border-4 border-[#1E3A5F]/20 shadow-xl flex items-center justify-center relative group"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1E3A5F] to-[#5B2C6F] rounded-full opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"></div><span class="text-2xl font-bold font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] text-[#1E3A5F] relative z-10 group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300">6</span></div></div><div class="flex-1 w-full lg:w-auto"><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 relative group overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-2 h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#1E3A5F] to-[#5B2C6F]"></div><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;]">Neutral Facilitation</h3><p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">The mediator remains neutral while encouraging open discussion and guiding the parties toward practical dispute resolution.</p></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-8 lg:flex-row"><div class="flex-1 hidden lg:block"></div><div class="relative z-10 flex-shrink-0"><div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-white border-4 border-[#1E3A5F]/20 shadow-xl flex items-center justify-center relative group"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1E3A5F] to-[#5B2C6F] rounded-full opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"></div><span class="text-2xl font-bold font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] text-[#1E3A5F] relative z-10 group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300">7</span></div></div><div class="flex-1 w-full lg:w-auto"><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 relative group overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-2 h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#1E3A5F] to-[#5B2C6F]"></div><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;]">Resolution Agreement</h3><p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">The mediator prepares a written summary or draft agreement outlining the terms accepted by the parties. The agreement may be reviewed by an attorney before signing.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-50 relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0"><div class="blob bg-[#1E3A5F]/10 w-[800px] h-[800px] top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-20"></div></div><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center"><div class="order-2 lg:order-1 relative group"><div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-[#1E3A5F]/10 rounded-[2.5rem] blur-xl opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity duration-500"></div><div class="relative rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 shadow-2xl h-[500px]"><img src="/src/assets/office-shoot-264.jpg" alt="Why Choose Mediation" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/30 via-transparent to-transparent opacity-60"></div></div></div><div class="order-1 lg:order-2"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-[#d1e9ea] rounded-full mb-6 border border-[#b3d9db]"><span class="text-[#1E3A5F] font-bold text-sm tracking-wide uppercase">Benefits</span></div><h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] mb-8">Why Choose <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[#1E3A5F] to-[#5B2C6F]">Mediation</span></h2><p class="text-slate-600 text-lg mb-12">Mediation provides a constructive path for parties to find common ground outside the courtroom.</p><div class="grid gap-6"><div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-sm border border-slate-100 transition-transform duration-300 group flex items-start gap-5"><div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#5B2C6F] to-[#3E1A4D] text-white shadow-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-xl group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"><img src="/src/assets/fleur-de-lis.png" alt="Fleur-de-lis" class="w-6 h-6 object-contain"/></div><div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;]">Open Dialogue</h3><p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Encourages open, productive dialogue.</p></div></div><div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-sm border border-slate-100 transition-transform duration-300 group flex items-start gap-5"><div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#5B2C6F] to-[#3E1A4D] text-white shadow-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-xl group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"><img src="/src/assets/fleur-de-lis.png" alt="Fleur-de-lis" class="w-6 h-6 object-contain"/></div><div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;]">Confidentiality</h3><p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Maintains confidentiality by keeping mediation discussions private.</p></div></div><div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-sm border border-slate-100 transition-transform duration-300 group flex items-start gap-5"><div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#5B2C6F] to-[#3E1A4D] text-white shadow-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-xl group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"><img src="/src/assets/fleur-de-lis.png" alt="Fleur-de-lis" class="w-6 h-6 object-contain"/></div><div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;]">Faster Resolution</h3><p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Resolves disputes more quickly and helps avoid court litigation.</p></div></div><div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-sm border border-slate-100 transition-transform duration-300 group flex items-start gap-5"><div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#5B2C6F] to-[#3E1A4D] text-white shadow-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-xl group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"><img src="/src/assets/fleur-de-lis.png" alt="Fleur-de-lis" class="w-6 h-6 object-contain"/></div><div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;]">Cost-Effective</h3><p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Offers a cost-effective alternative to expensive court battles.</p></div></div><div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-sm border border-slate-100 transition-transform duration-300 group flex items-start gap-5"><div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#5B2C6F] to-[#3E1A4D] text-white shadow-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-xl group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"><img src="/src/assets/fleur-de-lis.png" alt="Fleur-de-lis" class="w-6 h-6 object-contain"/></div><div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;]">Party Control</h3><p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Allows parties to retain control over the outcome.</p></div></div><div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-sm border border-slate-100 transition-transform duration-300 group flex items-start gap-5"><div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#5B2C6F] to-[#3E1A4D] text-white shadow-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-xl group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"><img src="/src/assets/fleur-de-lis.png" alt="Fleur-de-lis" class="w-6 h-6 object-contain"/></div><div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;]">Virtual Sessions</h3><p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Provides virtual sessions accessible from anywhere in the world.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-white py-20 md:py-24"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="mb-12 text-center"><div class="mb-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#1E3A5F]/20 bg-[#1E3A5F]/5 px-4 py-2"><img src="/src/assets/fleur-de-lis.png" alt="Fleur-de-lis" class="w-5 h-5 object-contain "/><span class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#1E3A5F]">Client Experiences</span></div><h2 class="font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 md:text-5xl">Mediation <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[#1E3A5F] to-[#5B2C6F]">Reviews</span></h2></div><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl space-y-8"><figure class="rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50 p-8 shadow-sm md:p-10"><div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#5B2C6F] to-[#3E1A4D] text-white shadow-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-xl mb-6"><img src="/src/assets/fleur-de-lis.png" alt="Fleur-de-lis" class="w-6 h-6 object-contain"/></div><blockquote class="font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] text-lg italic leading-relaxed text-slate-700 md:text-xl">“Ms. Outlaw is a phenomenal mediator. She took extremely tense moments and somehow made them comfortable, productive, and even humorous. She has a remarkable ability to relate to people, help them see logic, and encourage fairness without making anyone feel unheard. I am beyond grateful for her. I went from the very real possibility of not seeing my 6-year-old son during the school year except every other weekend—only four days per month—to receiving TOTAL equal parenting time. 🙌🏿😂🤎 If it were not for Ms. Outlaw, I truly believe my relationship with my son would have ultimately been impaired….4 days per month would’ve been a tragedy. And honestly, I received so much more than that but for the sake of time I’ll just say I felt heard, respected, and understood throughout the process. Ms. Outlaw is a GODSEND, and it is my absolute pleasure to write this review.”</blockquote><figcaption class="mt-6 border-t border-slate-200 pt-5 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#1E3A5F]">Wayne, Montgomery County, MD</figcaption></figure><figure class="rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50 p-8 shadow-sm md:p-10"><div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#5B2C6F] to-[#3E1A4D] text-white shadow-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-xl mb-6"><img src="/src/assets/fleur-de-lis.png" alt="Fleur-de-lis" class="w-6 h-6 object-contain"/></div><blockquote class="font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] text-lg italic leading-relaxed text-slate-700 md:text-xl">“Thank you again for the opportunity to observe your thoughtful and skillful approach to mediation. It was truly a valuable experience, and I learned so much from watching your approach, especially the way you connected with and listened to both parties.”</blockquote><figcaption class="mt-6 border-t border-slate-200 pt-5 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#1E3A5F]">Michelle Jones, Mediator, Maryland</figcaption></figure></div></div></section></div>"`;

exports[`public site renders unchanged > page /online-payment 1`] = `"<link rel="preload" as="image" href="/src/assets/Online%20Payment.png"/><div class="overflow-hidden bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="w-full"><img src="/src/assets/Online%20Payment.png" alt="Online Payment" class="w-full h-auto block"/></div><section class="py-20 md:py-24 bg-white relative"><div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-30 pointer-events-none"><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#1E3A5F]/50 to-transparent"></div></div><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16"><div class="order-2 lg:order-1"><div class="bg-white rounded-[2rem] p-8 md:p-10 border border-slate-200 shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#1E3A5F] to-[#722F37]"></div><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] mb-2">Make a Payment</h2><p class="text-slate-600 mb-8">Securely pay your invoice or retainer fee with PayPal or a credit/debit card.</p><div class="space-y-6"><div><label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-2">Name</label><div class="relative"><div class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 pl-4 flex items-center pointer-events-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-user text-slate-400" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H9a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg></div><input type="text" class="block w-full pl-11 pr-4 py-3 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#1E3A5F] focus:border-[#1E3A5F] outline-none transition-colors" placeholder="Jane Doe" maxLength="127" required="" value=""/></div></div><div><label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-2">Description</label><div class="relative"><div class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 pl-4 flex items-center pointer-events-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-text text-slate-400" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"></path><path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5"></path><path d="M10 9H8"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path></svg></div><input type="text" class="block w-full pl-11 pr-4 py-3 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#1E3A5F] focus:border-[#1E3A5F] outline-none transition-colors" placeholder="Payment for services" maxLength="127" required="" value=""/></div></div><div><label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-2">Payment Amount (USD)</label><div class="relative"><div class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 pl-4 flex items-center pointer-events-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-dollar-sign text-slate-400" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="2" y2="22"></line><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path></svg></div><input type="number" min="1" max="100000" step="0.01" class="block w-full pl-11 pr-4 py-3 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#1E3A5F] focus:border-[#1E3A5F] outline-none transition-colors" placeholder="0.00" required="" value=""/></div></div><div class="pt-4"><div class="w-full bg-slate-100 text-slate-400 font-bold rounded-full py-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 cursor-not-allowed border border-slate-200"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-dollar-sign" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="2" y2="22"></line><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path></svg><span class="text-lg">Fill in all fields to pay</span></div><p class="text-center text-xs text-slate-500 mt-4">Your payment is processed securely through PayPal. We never see your card details.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="order-1 lg:order-2 flex flex-col justify-center"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-[#1E3A5F]/10 rounded-full mb-6 border border-[#1E3A5F]/30 w-fit"><span class="text-[#1E3A5F] font-bold text-sm tracking-wide uppercase">Contact Info</span></div><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] mb-6">Need Assistance?</h2><p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-8">If you have questions regarding your invoice or experience any issues submitting your payment, please contact our office.</p><div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-200"><div class="space-y-6 text-slate-700"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#1E3A5F]/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-phone-call text-[#1E3A5F]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 2a9 9 0 0 1 9 9"></path><path d="M13 6a5 5 0 0 1 5 5"></path><path d="M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384"></path></svg></div><div><p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Phone</p><a href="tel:+12025482999" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-[#722F37] transition-colors block mt-1">(202) 548-2999</a><a href="tel:+12025488114" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-[#722F37] transition-colors block mt-1">(202) 548-8114</a></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#1E3A5F]/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-mail text-[#1E3A5F]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7"></path><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"></rect></svg></div><div><p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Email</p><a href="mailto:lawfirm@pjoutlawlegal.com" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-[#722F37] transition-colors block mt-1">lawfirm@pjoutlawlegal.com</a></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#1E3A5F]/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-map-pin text-[#1E3A5F]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg></div><div><p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Office</p><p class="text-slate-600 mt-1">412 H Street, NE<br/>Washington, DC 20002</p></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-xl"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check-big text-green-600 flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335"></path><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"></path></svg><div><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-green-800">Secure Payment</p><p class="text-xs text-green-700">All transactions are encrypted and processed by PayPal. Your financial information is never stored on our servers.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section></div>"`;

exports[`public site renders unchanged > page /practice-areas 1`] = `"<title>Practice Areas &amp; Case Highlights | Phyllis J. Outlaw &amp; Associates</title><div class="bg-white"><section class="bg-[#1E3A5F] text-white py-14 md:py-20"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8"><p class="text-[#E4C76C] text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-5">Phyllis J. Outlaw &amp; Associates</p><h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] leading-tight max-w-4xl">Practice Areas &amp; Case Highlights</h1></div></section><section class="py-12 md:py-16" aria-label="Our practice areas"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8"><p class="text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Phyllis J. Outlaw &amp; Associates provides comprehensive legal services tailored to each client’s needs. Our practice areas include arbitration and mediation; family law matters, including divorce, complex marital property and business assets, custody, and child support; personal injury claims, including auto torts and medical malpractice; real estate; probate; consumer law; business and corporate law; and labor and employment matters, including wrongful termination, equal employment opportunity, discrimination, and administrative proceedings before federal and local agencies. We advise clients on the purchase, sale, financing, leasing, management, and renovation of real estate.</p></div></section><section id="personal-injury" aria-labelledby="personal-injury-title" class="py-12 md:py-16 scroll-mt-8 bg-slate-50"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-9 lg:gap-14 items-start"><div><h2 id="personal-injury-title" class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1E3A5F] font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] leading-tight mb-6">Automobile, Medical Malpractice, Product Liability, Slip and Fall</h2><p class="text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Phyllis J. Outlaw &amp; Associates has represented hundreds of clients in personal injury matters. Our attorneys assist clients in securing quality medical care, managing medical expenses, and seeking compensation for lost wages, pain, and suffering. Some cases have involved multiple corporations and the general liability issues that commonly arise on construction projects.</p><div class="mt-8 border-l-4 border-[#C5A03A] bg-[#f7f4ec] p-6"><h3 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#1E3A5F] mb-3">Case Highlight</h3><p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Our firm won a substantial award for a pedestrian whose foot was run over by a construction truck at a job site.</p></div></div><div class=""><img src="/src/assets/practice-areas/0300.png" alt="Woman speaking on a phone beside two damaged cars after an automobile collision" width="1280" height="853" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md"/><a href="tel:+12025482999" class="mt-5 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-[#3a4381] px-5 py-5 text-white text-center font-semibold hover:bg-[#30386c] transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-[#3a4381]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-phone shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384"></path></svg><span>Schedule a free consultation. 202-548-2999</span></a></div></div></section><section id="corporate-governance" aria-labelledby="corporate-governance-title" class="py-12 md:py-16 scroll-mt-8 bg-white"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-9 lg:gap-14 items-start"><div><h2 id="corporate-governance-title" class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1E3A5F] font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] leading-tight mb-6">Corporate Governance</h2><p class="text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Our firm represents multimillion-dollar corporations, nonprofit organizations and small businesses in government proceedings. We develop compliance systems that meet agency requirements and prepare articles of incorporation and bylaws. We also counsel organizations on formation, expansion, partnership agreements, corporate records, dissolution, risk management, and securing federal and local tax-exempt status.</p><div class="mt-8 border-l-4 border-[#C5A03A] bg-[#f7f4ec] p-6"><h3 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#1E3A5F] mb-3">Case Highlight</h3><p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Phyllis J. Outlaw &amp; Associates achieved successful outcomes for multimillion-dollar businesses in litigation matters.</p></div></div><div class="lg:order-first"><img src="/src/assets/practice-areas/corporate-governance.webp" alt="Illustration of a diverse business team with a man leading a meeting" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md"/></div></div></section><section class="bg-[#1E3A5F] py-12 md:py-16 text-white" aria-labelledby="client-testimonial-title"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 text-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-quote mx-auto mb-5 text-[#E4C76C]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"></path><path d="M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"></path></svg><h2 id="client-testimonial-title" class="text-sm font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-[#E4C76C] mb-6">Client Testimonial</h2><blockquote><p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-white font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] leading-relaxed">“Phyllis J. Outlaw &amp; Associates provides exceptional legal services and always represents our best interest. The attorneys are accessible and highly responsive to our requests.”</p><footer class="mt-6 text-white/85 font-medium">Council of Women Ministers &amp; Male Support Division, Inc. Washington, DC</footer></blockquote></div></section><section id="employment-labor" aria-labelledby="employment-labor-title" class="py-12 md:py-16 scroll-mt-8 bg-slate-50"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-9 lg:gap-14 items-start"><div><h2 id="employment-labor-title" class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1E3A5F] font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] leading-tight mb-6">Employment &amp; Labor law</h2><p class="text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Phyllis J. Outlaw &amp; Associates represents federal, local government, and private-sector employees in Maryland and the District of Columbia in matters involving wrongful termination, unemployment compensation, retirement benefits, and discrimination.</p><div class="mt-8 border-l-4 border-[#C5A03A] bg-[#f7f4ec] p-6"><h3 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#1E3A5F] mb-3">Case Highlight</h3><p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Our firm represented a retired employee on appeal before the Federal Circuit in a retirement-benefits matter involving claims against both the District of Columbia and the Office of Personnel Management.</p></div></div><div class=""><img src="/src/assets/practice-areas/employment-labor.webp" alt="Illustration of employees peacefully protesting outside a business" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md"/></div></div></section><section id="construction" aria-labelledby="construction-title" class="py-12 md:py-16 scroll-mt-8 bg-white"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-9 lg:gap-14 items-start"><div><h2 id="construction-title" class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1E3A5F] font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] leading-tight mb-6">Construction and Construction-Related Issues</h2><p class="text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">The firm handles small commercial and residential construction projects and advises clients throughout every phase of the construction process, including contract negotiation and drafting for general contractors and subcontractors, permit acquisition, inspections, contractor payment draws, certificates of occupancy, change orders, code compliance, and architectural plans.</p><div class="mt-8 border-l-4 border-[#C5A03A] bg-[#f7f4ec] p-6"><h3 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#1E3A5F] mb-3">Case Highlight</h3><p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Phyllis J. Outlaw &amp; Associates litigated a case in the United States District Court for the District of Columbia involving structural and mechanical defects in the HVAC system of a newly renovated mixed-use commercial property. The firm brought claims against the architect for malpractice, the HVAC installer, and the construction inspection company, drawing on its knowledge of architectural and engineering plans. The court’s ruling was appealed to the United States Court of Appeals for the District of Columbia.</p></div></div><div class="lg:order-first"><img src="/src/assets/practice-areas/construction.webp" alt="Illustration of workers renovating the interior of a home" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md"/></div></div></section><section id="business-consulting" aria-labelledby="business-consulting-title" class="bg-slate-50 py-12 md:py-16 scroll-mt-8"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-9 lg:gap-14 items-start"><div><h2 id="business-consulting-title" class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1E3A5F] font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] leading-tight mb-6">Business Consulting</h2><p class="text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Phyllis J. Outlaw &amp; Associates provides results-focused consulting for business owners, executives, professionals, managers, and employees. Drawing on decades of legal and training experience, Attorney Outlaw assists clients in developing stronger leadership skills, resolving organizational challenges, and pursuing long-term goals with plans tailored to their business needs.</p></div><div><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#1E3A5F] font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] mb-6">How Business Consulting Can Help</h3><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-3 text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed marker:text-[#1E3A5F]"><li class="pl-2">Clarify business goals and vision</li><li class="pl-2">Strengthen team dynamics</li><li class="pl-2">Establish clear boundaries</li><li class="pl-2">Build stronger leadership skills</li><li class="pl-2">Manage transitions successfully</li><li class="pl-2">Create a plan aligned with your business purpose</li><li class="pl-2">Improve organizational management</li><li class="pl-2">Set career goals</li></ul></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="consulting-testimonials-title" class="bg-white py-12 md:py-16"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8"><h2 id="consulting-testimonials-title" class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1E3A5F] font-[&#x27;Playfair_Display&#x27;] text-center mb-9">Client Testimonials</h2><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8"><blockquote class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-6 sm:p-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-quote mb-5 text-[#1E3A5F]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"></path><path d="M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"></path></svg><p class="text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">“Phyllis J. Outlaw &amp; Associates exceeded my expectations. They helped me clarify my vision, prioritize my work, and develop a strong long-term business strategy. I gained healthier ways to manage workplace pressure and a better work-life balance. Their support was the missing piece I needed to move into my next stage of growth.”</p><footer class="mt-6 font-semibold text-[#1E3A5F]">Bonita Witherspoon, Washington, DC</footer></blockquote><blockquote class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-6 sm:p-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-quote mb-5 text-[#1E3A5F]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"></path><path d="M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"></path></svg><p class="text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">“A true partner in our success. Phyllis J. Outlaw &amp; Associates business coaching services have delivered lasting value through strategic direction, accountability, and practical solutions that work.”</p><footer class="mt-6 font-semibold text-[#1E3A5F]">Dr. Wayne Moore, Prince Georges County, MD</footer></blockquote></div></div></section><div class="py-10 text-center border-t border-slate-200"><a class="primary-button" href="/contact" data-discover="true">Contact Our Office <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div>"`;
